<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA- to Korea Telecom's yankee bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA- to Korea Telecom's yankee bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Thursday it had assigned its AA- rating to Korea Telecom's $200 million worth of 7.625 percent yankee bonds due April 15, 2007.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said.  </p>
<p>The rating reflects the company's dominant position and important role in the South Korean telecommunications market, a favourable regulatory environment and a very strong financial profile, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
